12
01:16:00,000 --> 01:16:06,000
Camp is a 2003 American musical comedy drama film written and directed by Todd
Graff about an upstate New York performing arts summer camp.

13
01:22:20,000 --> 01:22:26,000
The film is based on Graff's own experiences at a similar camp called
Stagedoor Manor, where many scenes of the film were filmed.

14
01:28:40,000 --> 01:28:46,000
Camp was released in the United States on July 25, 2003, by IFC Films.

15
01:35:00,000 --> 01:35:06,000
The film received generally positive reviews from critics.

16
01:41:20,000 --> 01:41:26,000
The film explores themes of summer camp, musical, coming of age, lgbt.

17
01:47:40,000 --> 01:47:46,000
The tone is lighthearted and emotional.
